# Regression (4.2.0/4.2.1): `shopForm(..., {}, false)` with `errors:
# list[FieldError]` in an imported module passed the checks (only the
# compiled file gets the full semantic check) and failed at `go build`
# ("cannot use map[string]interface{}{} ... as []*FieldError value"). A
